// How fast shards_players.tide's avatars walk, in a file of its own so that a second build of the game
// (shards_players_walk_next.tide in its place) has the same state laid out the same and another rule: the
// game's next build, which a server takes a sealed world up with (platform/tests/server_journal.mjs).
